  "term": "security operations",
  "definition": "Security operations refers to the monitoring and handling of security-related event data in distributed information systems, such as alerts produced by intrusion detection sensors. In this context, it involves interpreting those alerts consistently so machine-learning tools can support reliable security decisions.",
